                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ba67581-397b-3686-ba3e-71bbe07f296e",
                        "entry_id": "48963870-09ad-3b00-bd15-bdbefbf3737a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est fatal, funeste, qui est une cause de deuil, de tristesse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe979237-991b-4ad5-826e-58db1522a559",
                                "sense_id": "9ba67581-397b-3686-ba3e-71bbe07f296e",
                                "text": "Cependant, réalisée dans de mauvaises conditions, la combustion du bois émet des polluants néfastes pour la santé, tels que furanes, benzènes, dioxines, composés organiques volatils (COV)… ainsi que des particules fines nocives."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "099de473-0bb7-3423-b306-c91a4d75c80e",
                        "entry_id": "48963870-09ad-3b00-bd15-bdbefbf3737a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Il se disait, chez les Romains, des jours où il était défendu par la religion de vaquer aux affaires publiques, des jours de deuil et de tristesse destinés à l’inaction et regardés comme funestes, en mémoire de quelque disgrâce éclatante du peuple romain; → voir fastes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ancient"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc405a35-457b-4ecc-83e4-979e511cfff1",
                                "sense_id": "099de473-0bb7-3423-b306-c91a4d75c80e",
                                "text": "L’anniversaire de la journée d’Allia et celui de la défaite de Cannes étaient des jours néfastes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79a1ec78-ad37-4e13-8d49-cd10e249c865",
                        "source_entry_id": "48963870-09ad-3b00-bd15-bdbefbf3737a",
                        "source_sense_id": "099de473-0bb7-3423-b306-c91a4d75c80e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Préjudiciable",
                        "target_lang_word": "nefarious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nefarious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                        "entry_id": "d95701c6-e294-30d9-8b70-bac661bd7000",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sinful, villainous, criminal, or wicked, especially when noteworthy or notorious for such characteristics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6908e4be-a78d-40f4-9494-cb25c3833e66",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "Aliens have a nefarious connotation in many science fiction books."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d022cd16-b1c5-48b9-8f0d-6fbd820d1dd0",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "\"If the vessel be no fair-trading slaver, nor a common cruiser of his Majesty, it is as tangible as the best man's reasoning, that she may be neither more nor less than the ship of that nefarious pirate the Red Rover.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df001a74-bb30-4e86-aea9-487932b899c4",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "Mommsen […]declares that Catiline in particular was \"one of the most nefarious men in that nefarious age. His villanies belong to the criminal records, not to history.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "453aa0db-b52c-49fd-a62b-a63f38e28dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "The fact that the room was still in darkness made it obvious that something nefarious was afoot. Plainly there was dirty work in preparation at the cross-roads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f385b39b-409e-481c-82e9-7b415efcea91",
                                                "sense_id": "2a175dfa-9a39-3d12-abdf-c6f8bc170c2b",
                                                "text": "“I try to let everyone back here in Minnesota know exactly the nefarious activities that are taking place in Washington.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "71286813-06d7-4cc0-a016-5bae0c9bf806",
                        "source_entry_id": "48963870-09ad-3b00-bd15-bdbefbf3737a",
